    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the vehicle and traffic law and the real property law, in\nrelation to manufactured home certificates of title, and the conveyance and\nencumbrance of manufactured homes as real property",
    "basePrintNo": "S7120",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7120-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
